1
00:00:01,640 --> 00:00:03,660
Huh, it's probably just allergies.

2
00:00:14,620 --> 00:00:17,060
If it were me,
I'd never make you cry.

3
00:00:24,860 --> 00:00:25,860
I'm sorry.

4
00:00:25,940 --> 00:00:27,720
Okumi-san is the only one for me.

5
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,780
I was so frustrated,
so I didn't want to admit it.

6
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:33,340
Hideaki collapsed from overwork.

7
00:00:41,320 --> 00:00:42,320
No.

8
00:00:45,220 --> 00:00:46,220
What's wrong?

9
00:00:46,221 --> 00:00:47,460
You look terrified.

10
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:49,280
Are you kidding me?

11
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:53,120
Overwork? A follow-up exam?

12
00:00:54,260 --> 00:00:57,180
Think about how I feel! I had to find
out you were sick from someone else!

13
00:00:59,440 --> 00:01:00,710
Things got this bad,

14
00:01:01,240 --> 00:01:02,960
so why was I the only one kept in the dark?

15
00:01:05,060 --> 00:01:06,840
What do I even mean to you?

16
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:11,460
Wanting to help you, protect you,
hoping you'd rely on me.

17
00:01:13,020 --> 00:01:15,660
It's completely meaningless
if I'm the only one who feels that way.

18
00:01:18,120 --> 00:01:20,120
Seriously, stop messing around.

19
00:01:25,640 --> 00:01:26,640
I'm sorry.

20
00:01:28,040 --> 00:01:29,176
You think a simple
'sorry' fixes everything?

21
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,200
Idiot.

22
00:01:35,080 --> 00:01:36,080
No.

23
00:01:36,140 --> 00:01:38,580
I didn't want to show
up looking so exhausted.

24
00:01:39,220 --> 00:01:41,140
I'm already an old man as it is.

25
00:01:42,780 --> 00:01:43,780
I'm sorry.

26
00:01:44,580 --> 00:01:46,580
You've been an old man
ever since we met.

27
00:01:47,360 --> 00:01:49,900
Besides, won't I become
an old man eventually too?

28
00:01:50,700 --> 00:01:51,700
Or are you saying,

29
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:54,560
you'll hate me when I get old?

30
00:01:54,860 --> 00:01:56,100
Of course not.

31
00:01:56,500 --> 00:01:58,759
Even when you get old,
I'll definitely still love you.

32
00:01:58,760 --> 00:01:59,660
Is that so?

33
00:01:59,740 --> 00:02:00,740
Me too.

34
00:02:05,980 --> 00:02:07,140
What?

35
00:02:07,340 --> 00:02:09,000
Nothing.

36
00:02:11,860 --> 00:02:13,930
Are you hungry by any chance?

37
00:02:15,530 --> 00:02:19,340
Now that you mention it,
I haven't eaten much lately.

38
00:02:20,680 --> 00:02:22,700
(This old man is hopeless.)

39
00:02:24,980 --> 00:02:26,300
I'm going to borrow your kitchen.

40
00:02:38,800 --> 00:02:41,800
"Are the Sexy Buttocks Not Good?"

41
00:02:42,200 --> 00:02:47,500
(Episode 8)

42
00:02:54,540 --> 00:02:56,040
I talked a big game,

43
00:02:56,960 --> 00:02:59,140
but all I can make are rice balls.

44
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,400
Stop taking pictures and eat.

45
00:03:13,120 --> 00:03:15,460
Come on, eat up.

46
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,060
Thanks for the food.

47
00:03:36,880 --> 00:03:38,450
It's delicious.

48
00:03:42,520 --> 00:03:44,240
It tastes like Ai-chan.

49
00:03:45,620 --> 00:03:47,160
That sounds so gross.

50
00:03:50,420 --> 00:03:52,680
Why didn't you eat anything
when you were starving?

51
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,540
It felt like too much work.

52
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,820
You're even more useless than I am.

53
00:03:58,640 --> 00:03:59,940
I'm so ashamed.

54
00:04:02,360 --> 00:04:04,000
Go to sleep as soon as you finish eating.

55
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,740
I won't jump you.

56
00:04:07,580 --> 00:04:09,020
Will you sleep next to me?

57
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:11,120
Alright, alright.

58
00:04:11,420 --> 00:04:12,740
I'll sleep next to you.

59
00:04:13,160 --> 00:04:14,160
Huh?

60
00:04:20,920 --> 00:04:22,220
So much for jumping me.

61
00:04:23,700 --> 00:04:25,780
He fell asleep three seconds
after saying goodnight.

62
00:05:13,280 --> 00:05:14,440
Ai-chan?

63
00:05:29,060 --> 00:05:30,060
Did he go home?

64
00:05:31,320 --> 00:05:32,760
I wonder if he got home safely.

65
00:05:38,100 --> 00:05:39,739
Things got this bad,

66
00:05:39,740 --> 00:05:41,780
so why was I the only one kept in the dark?

67
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,920
Stop messing around.

68
00:05:44,780 --> 00:05:46,620
What do I even mean to you?

69
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:53,480
If I actually collapsed,
would he make that face too?

70
00:05:56,220 --> 00:06:00,240
A grown man acting like this,
I can't blame him for being disgusted.

71
00:06:04,000 --> 00:06:05,800
(Health Checkup Results)

72
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:09,720
Has he given up on me?

73
00:06:18,380 --> 00:06:19,400
Ai-chan.

74
00:06:22,580 --> 00:06:24,200
I'm going to stay here for a while.

75
00:06:24,700 --> 00:06:25,480
Huh?

76
00:06:25,481 --> 00:06:27,940
Wait,
you didn't want to live together before.

77
00:06:29,100 --> 00:06:30,100
I'm worried about you.

78
00:06:30,660 --> 00:06:33,260
I'm here to keep an eye on you.
You better eat and sleep properly.

79
00:06:34,960 --> 00:06:35,960
Ai-chan.

80
00:06:37,100 --> 00:06:41,740
When I heard you
collapsed, I... I was terrified...

81
00:06:46,940 --> 00:06:47,940
Thank you.

82
00:06:55,500 --> 00:06:56,500
Listen,

83
00:06:58,680 --> 00:07:03,060
please care about yourself
as much as you care about me.

84
00:07:11,360 --> 00:07:12,760
Why are you hard?

85
00:07:13,060 --> 00:07:14,060
Huh?

86
00:07:16,040 --> 00:07:17,390
Because I ate the rice balls.

87
00:07:19,600 --> 00:07:21,040
You're so greedy.

88
00:07:23,340 --> 00:07:27,120
Because I'm so greedy...

89
00:07:27,580 --> 00:07:30,310
Can I eat Ai-chan?

90
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:14,060
Dessert is a peach.

91
00:08:14,640 --> 00:08:16,390
Then I'll gladly dig in.

92
00:08:16,630 --> 00:08:19,260
I told you, acting like this
makes you an old man.

93
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:21,280
Do you not like it?

94
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:24,080
It's embarrassing.

95
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:29,570
Thanks for the food.

96
00:08:40,460 --> 00:08:42,840
The test results are out.

97
00:08:45,760 --> 00:08:47,040
Why haven't you opened them yet?

98
00:08:48,060 --> 00:08:50,620
If everything's fine,
are you going to move out?

99
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:54,460
Don't worry about that. Just look.

100
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:12,010
(No abnormalities
found in this examination)

101
00:09:15,520 --> 00:09:17,040
Don't make me worry again.

102
00:09:18,120 --> 00:09:19,580
Sorry for making you worry.

103
00:09:22,190 --> 00:09:23,589
Oh no, I'm going to be late.

104
00:09:23,590 --> 00:09:24,590
I'm heading out.

105
00:09:39,100 --> 00:09:41,800
And so, we started living together.

106
00:09:47,460 --> 00:09:48,520
I'm home.

107
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,490
Women's shoes?

108
00:10:01,760 --> 00:10:04,180
Hideaki, you're so slow.

109
00:10:04,280 --> 00:10:06,000
I told you I was coming over.

110
00:10:07,380 --> 00:10:08,500
- Who are you?
- Who are you?

111
00:10:11,700 --> 00:10:12,800
Good evening.

112
00:10:12,820 --> 00:10:14,020
I'm Hizaki Ainosuke.

113
00:10:14,480 --> 00:10:16,180
I'm an employee at Okumi-san's company.

114
00:10:17,020 --> 00:10:20,340
I don't live here.
I'm just crashing for a bit.

115
00:10:21,880 --> 00:10:23,590
An employee crashing here?

116
00:10:26,240 --> 00:10:27,640
I really am an employee.

117
00:10:29,100 --> 00:10:30,100
(What should I do?)

118
00:10:30,320 --> 00:10:32,520
(I can't blame her for thinking
I'm suspicious.)

119
00:10:33,600 --> 00:10:36,780
(But can I just come out and say
we're dating?)

120
00:10:37,580 --> 00:10:38,640
(Good grief.)

121
00:10:41,340 --> 00:10:42,360
Is Ai-chan okay?

122
00:10:43,800 --> 00:10:48,800
I wondered why you haven't been around.
Turns out you brought such a young kid

123
00:10:48,980 --> 00:10:50,260
into your home.

124
00:10:50,760 --> 00:10:51,820
That's not it.

125
00:10:52,040 --> 00:10:53,540
Ai-chan is my boyfriend.

126
00:10:54,040 --> 00:10:56,280
- Huh?
- Oh, I see.

127
00:10:57,600 --> 00:10:59,820
You found yourself such a cute kid.

128
00:11:00,980 --> 00:11:02,840
Whatever.
As long as you're serious about him.

129
00:11:03,400 --> 00:11:06,360
Looks like I'm interrupting.
I'll head home.

130
00:11:08,280 --> 00:11:10,160
See you next time, Ai-chan.

131
00:11:11,380 --> 00:11:13,180
Sis, I'll walk you out.

132
00:11:22,180 --> 00:11:26,000
Could I introduce him to my family
like that?

133
00:11:28,460 --> 00:11:29,460
Impossible.

134
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,380
I'm nowhere near ready for that.

135
00:11:48,180 --> 00:11:51,580
Bought taiyaki,
feeling ashamed of my boring self.

136
00:12:45,100 --> 00:12:45,900
(Next Episode Preview)

137
00:12:45,901 --> 00:12:47,679
He still has a long road ahead of him.

138
00:12:47,680 --> 00:12:50,160
Unlike the time I have left.

139
00:12:50,420 --> 00:12:53,280
The old man never asked you
to introduce him to your parents.

140
00:12:53,480 --> 00:12:55,740
I want to talk openly
about the person I love.

141
00:12:55,880 --> 00:12:57,620
Because these feelings are real.

142
00:12:57,700 --> 00:12:59,340
I want all of Okumi-san.
